  % instead of 6, implying that the rotational invariance is not manifest
  % anymore."  That is independent confirmation of science/normal-modes.md
  % SS 4 (translations exact everywhere, rotations only at a stationary
  % point).  It also confirms the PHVA attribution to Head, citing
  % Head1997 first and LiJensen2002 second.
}
